  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "PYTHON 金融程式設計",
    "sub_ename": "PYTHON FINANCIAL PROGRAMMING",
    "describe_ch": "透過Python程式設計，學生將能深入瞭解變數宣告、迴圈、邏輯判斷、陣列與子程式等核心概念，並培養程式邏輯應用及運算思維觀念。課程也將結合金融實例演練，協助學生了解Python在金融分析上的應用。",
    "describe_eh": "Through Python programming, students will gain a deeper understanding of core concepts such as variable declaration, loops, logical decision-making, arrays, and subroutines, and develop logical programming and computational thinking skills. The course will also incorporate financial examples to help students understand the application of Python in financial analysis.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
